  "title": "Chef John’s Rosemary Shortbread Cookies",
  "description": "Chef John’s rosemary shortbread cookie recipe yields tender, crumbly cookies with a subtle hint of rosemary. They might be better than typical shortbreads.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
